        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Collection 5020 Knob With 5048 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Baldwin made solid brass knob is the perfect addition to any period-style home. The ever popular Colonial Knobset is a reflection of times gone by. The 5020 knob with the 5048 rosette will fit a 1-3/8\" thick door with a 2-3/8\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith every detail, Baldwin hardware sends a message of quality and style\u0014 throughout the life of your door. For an investment in your home that will last for many years to come.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 5020 Colonial Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting to hide unsightly installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>Forged from solid brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>28 degree latch rotation</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch bolts springs.</li>\r\n<li>Latches are reversible for all door conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Latches include standard full lip strike.</li>\r\n<li>Latches have anti-friction insert for smooth operation</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" bore.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Solid Brass Colonial Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.125\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button. An emergency release function allows the knob to automatically unlock when it is turned from the inside.</li></ul>\r\n</p>",
